sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as +page.svelte
    participant Notes as Notes API
    participant Graph as GraphService / Backend
    participant FS as FilterState
    participant Store as graphStore
    participant GC as GraphCanvas
    participant G3D as Graph3DViewer
    participant GSP as GraphServiceLayoutProvider
    participant LV as Note list

    P->>Notes: getNotes()
    P->>Graph: getFullGraphData()
    alt graph-service 5xx / timeout / network error
        Graph->>Graph: fallback to backend /api/v1/graph/all
    end
    Notes-->>P: allNotes
    Graph-->>P: graphResult

    P->>P: normalize nodes & links

    P->>FS: filterState.filterGraphData(graphData, allNotes)
    FS-->>P: filteredGraphData
    P->>FS: filterState.applyFiltersAndSort(allNotes)
    FS-->>P: filteredNotes

    P->>Store: graphData / currentView

    Store->>GC: shared state (2D)
    Store->>G3D: shared state (3D)
    Store->>LV: shared state (List)

    Note over P: /graph/3d routes
    GSP->>Graph: getFullGraphData() / getGraphData(noteId, layout=3d)
    alt graph-service 5xx / timeout / network error
        Graph->>Graph: fallback to backend graph endpoints
    end
    Graph-->>GSP: 3D graph data
    GSP-->>G3D: nodes + links

    Note over GC: FloatingControls triggers filterState update
    Note over G3D: currentView = 3d uses graphStore
    Note over LV: currentView = list uses graphStore
    GC->>P: request update
    G3D->>P: request update
    LV->>P: request update
    P->>FS: re-derive filtered data
